      "id": "u_3cc50f885acd32745979eb1d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Calendar__TRILIUM_PH_1__ displays a week, month or year calendar with the notes being shown as events. New events can be added easily by dragging across the calendar.",
