    {
      "id": "u_b6b809476d4b0dbd421ea8db_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Classic collections__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "b6b809476d4b0dbd421ea8dbd15bb561433f3a0e7043c975b58324ba9521f5ca",
      "context": "Collections > Classic collections",
      "contextHash": "27f045627113f8447fa99252c89dffd49cef33e43d9fe31670c86b1d0dc7d96d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5f4c32a0d3da95a3cf784136_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Classic collections are read-only mode and compiles the contents of all child notes into one continuous view. This makes it ideal for reading extensive information broken into smaller, manageable segments.",
      "sourceHash": "5f4c32a0d3da95a3cf784136adc25ac3c30ac216aaa3aa8edd6d351d0a4fd0b8",
      "context": "Collections > Classic collections",
      "contextHash": "27f045627113f8447fa99252c89dffd49cef33e43d9fe31670c86b1d0dc7d96d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4c81ea792a61d94d74caedc8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Grid View__TRILIUM_PH_1__ which is the default presentation method for child notes (see __TRILIUM_PH_2__Note List__TRILIUM_PH_3__), where the notes are displayed as tiles with their title and content being visible.",
      "sourceHash": "4c81ea792a61d94d74caedc87a6c0c769aa937f16f35188da7e792ab481f1808",
      "context": "Collections > Classic collections",
      "contextHash": "27f045627113f8447fa99252c89dffd49cef33e43d9fe31670c86b1d0dc7d96d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0f95d08d2d06707209a90262_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__List View__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is similar to __TRILIUM_PH_2__Grid View__TRILIUM_PH_3__, but it displays the notes one under the other with the content being expandable/collapsible, but also works recursively.",
      "sourceHash": "0f95d08d2d06707209a9026218ad4c0b5b4889a49a6286f1f94584aa97c82219",
      "context": "Collections > Classic collections",
      "contextHash": "27f045627113f8447fa99252c89dffd49cef33e43d9fe31670c86b1d0dc7d96d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2defbf6e9a633e47f42ee277_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Classic collections make use of pagination to support a large number of notes. The size of a page can be customized via __TRILIUM_PH_0__.",
      "sourceHash": "2defbf6e9a633e47f42ee27786c27960944f44445cfa74e31b514f74114e9f0b",
      "context": "Collections > Classic collections",
      "contextHash": "27f045627113f8447fa99252c89dffd49cef33e43d9fe31670c86b1d0dc7d96d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cd01db0f550bb78a9df1770a_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Creating a new collection__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "cd01db0f550bb78a9df1770adeb512f19ed4d4006e64b60024550344adb1002b",
      "context": "Collections > Creating a new collection",
      "contextHash": "793e66eff2239d45141dc39f92a2e51a31247fbdb8a502416a34bc7e12a76d08",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5378efb4ddb97bb112e10151_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To create a new collection, right-click a note in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and select __TRILIUM_PH_2__Insert child note__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Collection__TRILIUM_PH_5__ → the desired type.",
      "sourceHash": "5378efb4ddb97bb112e10151e3a6833a1dcdefcc6216b76234aebcd70ad1020a",
      "context": "Collections > Creating a new collection",
      "contextHash": "793e66eff2239d45141dc39f92a2e51a31247fbdb8a502416a34bc7e12a76d08",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0cd4d52502bf1e6d632d87a1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "By default, collections come with a default configuration and sometimes even sample notes. To create a collection completely from scratch:",
      "sourceHash": "0cd4d52502bf1e6d632d87a1c114b859614c203e597ad99b3db6ffe48757b142",
      "context": "Collections > Creating a new collection",
      "contextHash": "793e66eff2239d45141dc39f92a2e51a31247fbdb8a502416a34bc7e12a76d08",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ebfb0084d9cc153b23bcbe5e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Create a new note of type __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (or any type).",
      "sourceHash": "ebfb0084d9cc153b23bcbe5efb2c76fe2d2b2b8141cb7d07f2781c7f637fa019",
      "context": "Collections > Creating a new collection",
      "contextHash": "793e66eff2239d45141dc39f92a2e51a31247fbdb8a502416a34bc7e12a76d08",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8d7253fef60828f28ebda649_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Change the __TRILIUM_PH_0__note type__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to __TRILIUM_PH_2__Collection__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "8d7253fef60828f28ebda649b480f566241f6a61a0e1b8e15c54603c7afd6162",
      "context": "Collections > Creating a new collection",
      "contextHash": "793e66eff2239d45141dc39f92a2e51a31247fbdb8a502416a34bc7e12a76d08",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_440bd55d24d29c52de5d0c38_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In __TRILIUM_PH_0__Collection Properties__TRILIUM_PH_1__, select the desired view type.",
      "sourceHash": "440bd55d24d29c52de5d0c38a047e0596b65b646b596795b95483cc99421d7a3",
      "context": "Collections > Creating a new collection",
      "contextHash": "793e66eff2239d45141dc39f92a2e51a31247fbdb8a502416a34bc7e12a76d08",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_858f894305cf1cca9e93b793_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Consult the help page of the corresponding view type in order to understand how to configure them.",
      "sourceHash": "858f894305cf1cca9e93b793dfd2534755618c07bd23bc28a4447e497ac60e70",
      "context": "Collections > Creating a new collection",
      "contextHash": "793e66eff2239d45141dc39f92a2e51a31247fbdb8a502416a34bc7e12a76d08",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_91e318d9b9bed0d1467013a3_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Configuration__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "91e318d9b9bed0d1467013a3e6d72d61f50dc1076d2d68cc43d0cdd7e4947ffe",
      "context": "Collections > Configuration",
      "contextHash": "6cf7b649186d8dacdf8b55427ec18a8533b38fadf023bf47d7b0fb315d115d50",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_da7ec0cacad783febbe2bdc1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To change the configuration of a collection or even switch to a different collection (e.g. from Kanban Board to a Calendar), see the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Collection Properties__TRILIUM_PH_1__ bar at the top of the note.",
      "sourceHash": "da7ec0cacad783febbe2bdc11eb2d89f716b417850c1636cb232db01bccc58c3",
      "context": "Collections > Configuration",
      "contextHash": "6cf7b649186d8dacdf8b55427ec18a8533b38fadf023bf47d7b0fb315d115d50",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f9c9ca53a4f73712b4b78b3f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Archived notes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "f9c9ca53a4f73712b4b78b3f8d3461564d93c77354d191175539ed4e5cca5ceb",
      "context": "Collections > Archived notes",
      "contextHash": "98bf3a61296d34c7198e4a687651e36e9095c43a0b73454fe7fbefdd689ee6ab",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_53a9bb0f7bb0ec20f089a96d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "By default, __TRILIUM_PH_0__archived notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ will not be shown in collections. This behavior can be changed by going to __TRILIUM_PH_2__Collection Properties__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and checking __TRILIUM_PH_4__Show archived notes__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "53a9bb0f7bb0ec20f089a96dcaa7e10b726b87e2f7a596894b4831139cdb9656",
      "context": "Collections > Archived notes",
      "contextHash": "98bf3a61296d34c7198e4a687651e36e9095c43a0b73454fe7fbefdd689ee6ab",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d4d72f844d433b235eb5b353_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Archived notes will be generally indicated by being greyed out as opposed to the normal ones.",
      "sourceHash": "d4d72f844d433b235eb5b35334c01c3ab2ccb4e5f9975df276bddb301c3e9702",
      "context": "Collections > Archived notes",
      "contextHash": "98bf3a61296d34c7198e4a687651e36e9095c43a0b73454fe7fbefdd689ee6ab",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4e23e7bdc3ab755303820600_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Hiding the child notes from the note tree__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "4e23e7bdc3ab755303820600cf6164d941008dcc5da0ff3c2ebb1870deb44375",
      "context": "Collections > Hiding the child notes from the note tree",
      "contextHash": "7368886c9c81bce75db608daa44c3a0f754458a7f03e3b0edaa091338b2d4313",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2385254a1b44fdf5b55493a9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For collections with a large number of items, it can be helpful to hide the items from the note tree for performance reasons and to reduce clutter. This is especially useful for standalone collections, such as a geomap or a task board.",
      "sourceHash": "2385254a1b44fdf5b55493a9601c4b5480f32ae16ef42ac7fbbc039a7fc01f86",
      "context": "Collections > Hiding the child notes from the note tree",
      "contextHash": "7368886c9c81bce75db608daa44c3a0f754458a7f03e3b0edaa091338b2d4313",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fdce7a6c1234da1459cff6f5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To do so, go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Collection Properties__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and select __TRILIUM_PH_2__Hide child notes in tree__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "fdce7a6c1234da1459cff6f58bf9770a0489db72015568d4a84a8e8bfa6ba92c",
      "context": "Collections > Hiding the child notes from the note tree",
      "contextHash": "7368886c9c81bce75db608daa44c3a0f754458a7f03e3b0edaa091338b2d4313",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
