    },
    {
      "id": "u_ae64590fa2d65ccb4b335710_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Now the text will be displayed above while still maintaining the collection view.",
      "sourceHash": "ae64590fa2d65ccb4b3357102d11b5e729fdc3b94160cbfbba47a0bfa887002d",
      "context": "Collections > Advanced use cases > Adding a description to a collection",
      "contextHash": "731d3de59924b70ed870b7b6fef7c3d82d959385f43b7703e8e5cc68a4e75801",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_10cb98b4d866bf655181b9ed_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The only downside to this method is that __TRILIUM_PH_0__Collection Properties__TRILIUM_PH_1__ will not be shown anymore. In this case, modify the attributes manually or switch back temporarily to the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Collection__TRILIUM_PH_3__ type for configuration purposes.",
      "sourceHash": "10cb98b4d866bf655181b9edf822fc41ca30be7768bc99774cea983804d5502b",
      "context": "Collections > Advanced use cases > Adding a description to a collection",
      "contextHash": "731d3de59924b70ed870b7b6fef7c3d82d959385f43b7703e8e5cc68a4e75801",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2b45343b3a9c713ffea37c6b_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Using saved search__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2b45343b3a9c713ffea37c6bcb7a9bdc9cc485646fcfe2ab1cbb7dd6c235d16f",
      "context": "Collections > Advanced use cases > Using saved search",
      "contextHash": "5700bae2e40c4917ae04d3aa62f0e9e1929e284e905609a3b0a44db6e5c65779",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a8a25e79cfd3771b0efb40e4_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Collections, by default, only display the child notes. However, it is possible to use the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Search__TRILIUM_PH_1__ functionality to display notes all across the tree, with advanced querying functionality.",
      "sourceHash": "a8a25e79cfd3771b0efb40e41c4864c9b30f58d1c5cd9cea60398db3219842ee",
      "context": "Collections > Advanced use cases > Using saved search",
      "contextHash": "5700bae2e40c4917ae04d3aa62f0e9e1929e284e905609a3b0a44db6e5c65779",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fa28d50f5949a0eab12f1b97_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To do so, simply start a __TRILIUM_PH_0__Search__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and go to the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Collection Properties__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and select a desired type of collection. To keep the search-based collection, use a __TRILIUM_PH_4__Saved Search__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "fa28d50f5949a0eab12f1b97e3357ae016c59938f723d7214d88276276b63664",
      "context": "Collections > Advanced use cases > Using saved search",
      "contextHash": "5700bae2e40c4917ae04d3aa62f0e9e1929e284e905609a3b0a44db6e5c65779",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2f89da5e4ee7ef8eb890af4a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "While in search, none of the collections will not display the child notes of the search results. The reason is that the search might hit a note multiple times, causing an exponential rise in the number of results.",
      "sourceHash": "2f89da5e4ee7ef8eb890af4a7457c15b4f540c8e6b43ac930cfe597191722dc4",
      "context": "Collections > Advanced use cases > Using saved search",
      "contextHash": "5700bae2e40c4917ae04d3aa62f0e9e1929e284e905609a3b0a44db6e5c65779",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8b43d4cd1e24f1e09f3bc8ad_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Under the hood__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "8b43d4cd1e24f1e09f3bc8adc1e2bf1e2e5c28b4683c6f37dbe4d1a7c64c481e",
      "context": "Collections > Under the hood",
      "contextHash": "b617fec4059442e576dc77aa1bdc68f651c48f4cb266e46443974a4c13a946c6",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8c61bef226e241398d75edc1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Collections by themselves are simply notes with no content that rely on the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note List__TRILIUM_PH_1__ mechanism (the one that lists the children notes at the bottom of a note) to display information.",
      "sourceHash": "8c61bef226e241398d75edc19b0a48192d0ffd3c5d6d245f1b6e061bc7ceaefd",
      "context": "Collections > Under the hood",
      "contextHash": "b617fec4059442e576dc77aa1bdc68f651c48f4cb266e46443974a4c13a946c6",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_99bd2b4897fdcbbddc9f692e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "By default, new collections use predefined __TRILIUM_PH_0__Templates__TRILIUM_PH_1__ that are stored safely in the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Hidden Notes__TRILIUM_PH_3__ to define some basic configuration such as the type of view, but also some __TRILIUM_PH_4__Promoted Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_5__ to make editing easier.",
      "sourceHash": "99bd2b4897fdcbbddc9f692ec8db0d869e250523fe8ed3ad9ba52d465e398b80",
      "context": "Collections > Under the hood",
      "contextHash": "b617fec4059442e576dc77aa1bdc68f651c48f4cb266e46443974a4c13a946c6",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a5931bd0384697a9e4474ac0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Collections don't store their configuration (e.g. the position on the map, the hidden columns in a table) in the content of the note itself, but as attachments.",
      "sourceHash": "a5931bd0384697a9e4474ac05fdd4e3f53f2d8edc7d110680b5f2e6155e4cd23",
      "context": "Collections > Under the hood",
      "contextHash": "b617fec4059442e576dc77aa1bdc68f651c48f4cb266e46443974a4c13a946c6",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
